### GET /api/cart — functional (port 3000)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### GET /api/cart — OOP (port 3001)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### POST /api/cart/items — functional (rezerwuje stock na 15 min)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### POST /api/cart/items — OOP
POST http://localhost:3001/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### PUT /api/cart/items/:productId — zmień ilość (functional)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### PUT /api/cart/items/:productId — zmień ilość (OOP)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### DELETE /api/cart/items/:productId — usuń produkt (functional)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### DELETE /api/cart/items/:productId — usuń produkt (OOP)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### DELETE /api/cart — wyczyść koszyk (functional)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### DELETE /api/cart — wyczyść koszyk (OOP)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
